### Pattern Description

This pattern provides workflow customization through pluggable workflow engines:

**Approach 1: Elsa Workflows (Recommended)**

Modern .NET workflow engine with visual designer and code activities:

```csharp
public class TexasProviderEnrollmentWorkflow : WorkflowBase
{
    protected override void Build(IWorkflowBuilder builder)
    {
        builder
            .StartWith<ReceiveApplication>()
            .Then<ValidateApplication>()
                .When(OutcomeNames.Done)
                .Then<ValidateProviderLicense>()
            .When("Valid")
                .Then<RequestBackgroundCheck>()
                .Then<WaitForBackgroundCheckResult>()
                    .When("Clear")
                    .Then<CreateProviderRecord>()
                    .Then<SendApprovalNotification>()
                    .Then("End")
                .When("Flagged")
                    .Then<EscalateToManualReview>()
            .When("Invalid")
                .Then<SendRejectionNotification>();
    }
}
```

**Custom Activities**:

```csharp
// Custom activity for Texas-specific validation
public class ValidateProviderLicense : Activity
{
    private readonly ITexasLicenseService _licenseService;

    protected override async Task<ActivityExecutionResult> OnExecuteAsync(
        ActivityExecutionContext context)
    {
        var application = context.GetInput<ProviderApplication>();

        // Texas-specific license validation
        var isValid = await _licenseService.ValidateLicenseAsync(
            application.LicenseNumber,
            application.ProviderType);

        context.SetOutput(application);
        return isValid
            ? Outcome("Valid")
            : Outcome("Invalid", "Texas license validation failed");
    }
}
```

